    art: 
    arrival: 'Ned[happy]: Ned! Hi! Don''t put me near water, my chains go all crunchy.

      Neighbours
      are great. Just not the weepy ones. Bit of a downer, no offence.'
    story:
    - 'Ned[sad]: I broke all of Mum''s good plates the night I... you know. Never
      said sorry.'
    - 'Ned[happy]: There''s a stack of plates in the hotel kitchen with Mum''s pattern.
      I glued one back together. It''s a start.'
